{"id":"H3195","lemma":"יְטוּר","transliteration":"yetur","sayIt":"ye-TUR","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Jetur","meaning":"A man of the Arabs living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.25.15;\nson of: Ishmael (H3458);\nbrother of: Nebaioth (H5032), Kedar (H6938), Adbeel (H0110), Mibsam (H4017), Mishma (H4927), Dumah (H1746), Massa (H4854), Hadad (H2301), Tema (H8485), Naphish (H5305), Kedemah (H6929) and Mahalath (H4258)\n§ Jetur = \"enclosed\"\n1) a son of Ishmael whose descendants warred with Israel east of the Jordan\n1a) also called 'Ituraea'","glosses":["jetur","well as jetur"],"count":3,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-25","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jetur","kjv":"Jetur"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":31,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jetur","kjv":"Jetur"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-5","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"as well as Jetur","kjv":"with Jetur"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 25:15","note":"Hadad, Tema, Jetur, Naphish, and Kedemah.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 1:31","note":"Jetur, Naphish, and Kedemah. These are the sons of Ishmael.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0110","lemma":"אַדְבְּאֵל","transliteration":"adbeel","gloss":"Adbeel"},{"id":"H1746","lemma":"דּוּמָה","transliteration":"dumah","gloss":"Dumah"},{"id":"H2301","lemma":"חֲדַד","transliteration":"chadad","gloss":"Hadad"},{"id":"H3458","lemma":"יִשְׁמָעֵאל","transliteration":"yishmael","gloss":"Ishmael"},{"id":"H5032","lemma":"נְבָיוֹת","transliteration":"nevavot","gloss":"Nebaioth"},{"id":"H6938","lemma":"קֵדָר","transliteration":"qedar","gloss":"Kedar"},{"id":"H4017","lemma":"מִבְשָׂם","transliteration":"mivsam","gloss":"Mibsam"},{"id":"H4927","lemma":"מִשְׁמָע","transliteration":"mishma","gloss":"Mishma"}],"senses":[{"id":"H3195H","gloss":"Jetur","relation":"H3195H ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}